---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-[#FAF6F0] border-t border-stone-200/60">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">

      <!-- GlastonCherry Event Poster Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="p-1 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-md">
          <img 
            src="/glastoncherry-poster.jpg" 
            alt="GlastonCherry Summer Fair Poster" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl object-cover" 
          />
          <div class="p-4 text-center">
            <p class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-800">GLASTONCHERRY Summer Fair</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-light mt-1">Cherry Garden School • Peckham</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-stone-200/80 text-stone-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
          <span>Cherry Garden School</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>GLASTONCHERRY</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-6">
          Sitting on the sub. Feeling the music.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700 font-light text-lg leading-relaxed text-pretty mb-8">
          <p>
            At Cherry Garden SEN School's summer fair, <span class="font-normal italic">GLASTONCHERRY</span>, we ran the sound system for the day for the kids, staff, and families.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="my-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 border-l-4 border-[#EE4223] font-serif text-2xl text-stone-800 leading-snug">
            "They pulled the sub out in front of the stack and let the kids sit and dance on the sub to feel the music. It was lovely. We can't wait for next year!"
          </blockquote>
          <p>
            This is what we live for: creating joyful, inclusive spaces where everyone gets to experience the music in their own way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a 
          href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Da2u67hjVNy/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white border border-stone-300 text-stone-900 font-medium hover:bg-stone-50 transition-colors shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>View GlastonCherry story on Instagram ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
